{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>האסיף</b> — Twice in the Masorah. One is this, and the other is האסיף תקופת השנה, and that is what is stated in the first chapter of Sanhedrin: וחג האסיף תקופת השנה — that חג האסיף must fall in a new tekufah. And how is this derived here? On the contrary, it would seemingly imply the opposite, that it is in an old tekufah. Rather, this is its meaning: חג האסיף begins with the going out of the year; if so, it must be in a new tekufah of the year."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:10.818224315Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}